@startuml
title Odoo 19 Cafe eCommerce Workflow - Without Product Accessories Module

start

:Customer visits Cafe eCommerce website;

:Browse products;

:Select a product;

:View product details;

if (Need complementary product?) then (Yes)
    :Customer manually searches\nfor another product;
    :Browse product list;
    :Select complementary product;
else (No)
endif

:Add product to cart;

:Review cart;

if (Continue shopping?) then (Yes)
    :Browse more products;
    :Select product;
    :Add product to cart;
else (No)
endif

:Proceed to checkout;

:Enter customer details;

:Select delivery/payment method;

:Confirm order;

:Odoo creates Sales Order;

:Delivery Order created;

:Stock reservation\naccording to Odoo settings;

:Process delivery;

:Validate delivery;

:Stock quantity decreases;

:Order completed;

stop

@enduml